5. Create Custom Policy for EC2-Admin
Left sidebar → Policies
Click Create policy
Click JSON
Remove existing code
Paste this:
{
    "Version": "2012-10-17",
    "Statement": [
        {
            "Sid": "EC2ViewOnly",
            "Effect": "Allow",
            "Action": [
                "ec2:Describe*"
            ],
            "Resource": "*"
        },
        {
            "Sid": "EC2StartStop",
            "Effect": "Allow",
            "Action": [
                "ec2:StartInstances",
                "ec2:StopInstances"
            ],
            "Resource": "*"
        }
    ]
}
Click Next

Policy name:

EC2-StartStop-View
Click Create policy
